{% comment %}
  Renders a layered wave divider filled with the background color of the surrounding color scheme.

  Accepts:
  - shape: {String} Default 'below'.
    'below' and 'above': three overlapping waves at 30%, 50% and 100% opacity, filled along the bottom or top edge.
    'ribbon': a ribbon in the surrounding scheme's color riding on a solid wave filled along the bottom edge.
      The solid wave uses the --wave-fill color (an RGB triplet), falling back to the scheme's background.
  - class: {String} Extra classes for the svg element (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'wave', shape: 'above', class: 'footer__wave' %}
{% endcomment %}

<svg
  class="wave wave--{{ shape | default: 'below' }}{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  viewBox="0 0 1280 {% if shape == 'ribbon' %}100{% else %}140{% endif %}"
  preserveAspectRatio="none"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
